{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08952","headline":"拟古诗十二首 八 · 韦应物","name":"拟古诗十二首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神州高爽地，遐瞰靡不通。\n寒月野无绿，寥寥天宇空。\n阴阳不停驭，贞脆各有终。\n汾沮何鄙俭，考盘何退穷。\n反志解牵局，无爲尚劳躬。\n美人夺南国，一笑开芙蓉。\n清镜理容发，褰帘出深重。\n艳曲呈皓齿，舞罗不堪风。\n慊慊情有待，赠芳爲我容。\n可嗟青楼月，流影君帷中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}